OL,3,GNEWSANew literary festival to inspire
OL,4,Anew writers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new literary festival to help
OL,7,Faspiring writers will be a "welcoming
OL,8,Fplace where writers and readers can
OL,9,Flearn from one another", organisers
OL,10,Fsay.
OL,12,FBarnard Castle Writing Group said it
OL,13,Fwould hold the first Write Hear! Write
OL,14,FNow! festival in late November.
OL,16,FThe event will feature creative writing
OL,17,Fand poetry workshops as well as an open
OL,18,Fmic session to give participants a
OL,19,Fchance to share their work with a live
OL,20,Faudience.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
