OL,3,GNEWSANew literary festival to inspire
OL,4,Anew writers
OL,5,
OL,6,FFestival convener Martyn Radcliffe said
OL,7,Fhe hoped it will become a yearly
OL,8,Ffixture for the town and "get a few
OL,9,Fpeople interested in the writing
OL,10,Fgroup".
